  (label "5V_P" (at 139.70 93.98 0) (fields_autoplaced yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9cbca8e4-9e59-5f0f-89ed-8a1d8c9de74c"))
  (text "SPI: CPOL 0, CPHA 1 (mode 1), MSB first, max 10 MHz; IRQ ACTIVE HIGH; no reset pin (power-cycle 3V3_P or command C0). DS12484 Rev 3." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.70 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3690f3e7-a628-534a-8407-7570115c84f1"))
  (text "Supply plan: VDD and VDD_TX from 5V_P (same supply, +-0.2 V); VDD_IO from 3V3_P; set sup3V only if supplied from 3.3 V. Do not supply VDD_A externally." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.70 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6b0e9f7e-9255-52f9-9588-a32fbd28417a"))
  (text "Decoupling per section 4.2.11: 2.2uF + 10nF on regulator pins, 1uF + 10nF on AGDC, 2.2uF + 1nF on VDD_AM. Net assignment on the right is a TO-CONFIRM placeholder." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.70 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "15c1059f-d4c1-54a7-961a-0b9b3e02b164"))
  (text "VDD_RF is tied to VDD_DR in this skeleton: CONFIRM against Figure 1 (above 350 mA both tie to VDD_TX instead)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.70 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "99f9c497-8d3d-5311-ad63-eb8756b0b6b4"))
  (text "To add after reading AN5276/AN5240/AN5322: antenna coil, EMC filter, matching network (fixed first, AAT later), 27.12 MHz crystal and load capacitors, exposed-pad thermal vias, layout." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 12.70 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8e0e2498-d93d-5989-b269-deea47be3b6f"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
